---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Advertise with us" current="">
  <section class="lp">
    <div class="lphero">
      <span class="lpkick">Advertise</span>
      <h2>Put your business in front of people who read about Austin every day.</h2>
      <p>Local Buzz ATX is an Austin news site built around one question: why should I care? Readers come to find out what is happening and what it means for them. That is a good moment to meet them.</p>
      <a class="lpbtn" href="#talk">Tell us about your business</a>
    </div>
    <div class="lpgrid">
      <div><b>Homepage banner</b><span>A labeled slot in the row under the top stories.</span></div>
      <div><b>Weekly Buzz sponsor</b><span>A short sponsor line in the weekly email, once the newsletter launches.</span></div>
      <div><b>Sponsored section</b><span>A "Local favorite" feature: a story about your business, clearly marked as sponsored.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lpsample">
      <div class="lplabel">How it works</div>
      <ol>
        <li><b>Tell us about your business.</b><em>Fill out the short form below.</em></li>
        <li><b>We suggest a fit and a price.</b><em>You see exactly where it will run before you pay.</em></li>
        <li><b>You approve it, we run it.</b><em>Every ad is labeled as an ad, so readers always know.</em></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="lpform2" id="talk">
      <h3>Tell us about your business</h3>
      <iframe class="formframe" src="https://tally.so/embed/2jaBxA?alignLeft=1&hideTitle=1&transparentBackground=1&dynamicHeight=1" title="Advertise with Local Buzz ATX" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      <small>Pick "Advertise" in the form.</small>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
